1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,133
Sri Lanka has no tigers, and no lions.

2
00:00:04,133 --> 00:00:06,707
Its only big cat is the leopard,

3
00:00:06,707 --> 00:00:09,810
found nowhere else on Earth.

4
00:00:09,810 --> 00:00:12,305
One of just two island leopards,

5
00:00:12,305 --> 00:00:14,254
and with no bigger rival,

6
00:00:14,254 --> 00:00:16,429
the top predator.

7
00:00:16,429 --> 00:00:18,396
In Yala, about one leopard

8
00:00:18,396 --> 00:00:20,666
for every 2 square kilometres,

9
00:00:20,666 --> 00:00:24,088
among the highest densities known.

10
00:00:24,088 --> 00:00:27,201
Its own subspecies, Panthera pardus kotiya,

11
00:00:27,201 --> 00:00:31,019
wears close-set rosettes on a tawny coat.

12
00:00:31,019 --> 00:00:33,558
Males average about 56 kilos.

13
00:00:33,558 --> 00:00:35,834
In the dry zone, it mostly

14
00:00:35,834 --> 00:00:38,347
hunts spotted deer.

15
00:00:38,347 --> 00:00:41,081
It lives island-wide, from dry scrub

16
00:00:41,081 --> 00:00:43,658
to rainforest and tea hills.

17
00:00:43,658 --> 00:00:46,903
Yet fewer than 1,000 adults remain.

18
00:00:48,653 --> 00:00:50,830
And most of the danger lies

19
00:00:50,830 --> 00:00:52,731
outside the parks.

20
00:00:52,731 --> 00:00:57,236
From 2008 to 2024, people killed

21
00:00:57,236 --> 00:01:01,183
at least 164 leopards.

22
00:01:01,183 --> 00:01:04,017
Where the cause was known, more than

23
00:01:04,017 --> 00:01:05,986
6 in 10 were wire snares,

24
00:01:05,986 --> 00:01:08,168
set for other animals.

25
00:01:08,168 --> 00:01:11,518
Nearly 40% were in one hill district,

26
00:01:11,518 --> 00:01:13,545
Nuwara Eliya.

27
00:01:13,545 --> 00:01:15,568
So how do we keep them?

28
00:01:15,568 --> 00:01:17,766
Link the forests, so they

29
00:01:17,766 --> 00:01:20,551
can move between them.

30
00:01:20,551 --> 00:01:24,653
Clear snares, and keep livestock safe at night.

31
00:01:24,653 --> 00:01:27,106
On safari, stay in the vehicle,

32
00:01:27,106 --> 00:01:29,539
and give them space.

33
00:01:29,539 --> 00:01:31,442
The island's only big cat

34
00:01:31,442 --> 00:01:34,174
needs room beyond the parks.
